# Desktop: the title, How to play (closed by a click outside it), the runtime's Options from Settings, the level
# list, studio-1 with the keys: a blocked roll, Hint, Esc back to the levels and the title, Continue resumes the
# level and D paints it; Enter on the finish card's focused Next level opens studio-2, where U undoes and R restarts.
# viewport 1280x800@1
until 300 =Play
frames 150
save title
click =How to play
until 60 =Close
frames 10
expect Roll right: →/D
save howto
click 10% 10%
frames 10
until 60 =Settings
frames 10
click =Settings
frames 60
save options
key F1 1
frames 20
click =Levels
until 60 Workshop
frames 10
save levels
click =Level 1
until 60 =Studio · 1
frames 30
expect Swipe, press an arrow key
key ArrowLeft 1
frames 10
expect =0
key KeyH 1
until 30 Try rolling right.
frames 10
save play
key Escape 1
until 60 Workshop
frames 10
key Escape 1
until 60 =Continue
frames 10
click =Continue
until 60 =Studio · 1
frames 10
key KeyD 1
until 120 =Painted!
frames 30
expect =1 moves · par 1
save complete
key Enter 2
until 60 =Studio · 2
frames 30
key ArrowRight 1
frames 40
key KeyU 1
frames 10
key ArrowDown 1
frames 40
key KeyR 1
frames 10
key ArrowRight 1
frames 2
key ArrowDown 1
until 120 =Painted!
frames 10
